window.products.push({"id":195079,"name":"NOVICA Multicolor Decorative Ceramic Sculpture, Catrina Painter'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDbRlJjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: A charming Catrina skeleton stands with a palette and paint brush in her hands, reflecting a passion for art. The artisans at Mexico's Amonite Kutsari work together to craft this sculpture of ceramic. The Catrina's beautiful skirt is painted by hand in shades of lapis and turquoise, accented with multicolored flowers and line motifs. Above the skirt, the striking Catrina wears a violet blouse.Color and/or motif may vary slightlyAbout our Artist: 'Amonite Kutsari is a group of artisans from Mexico City who share common interests, ideas, aims and dreams. In September 2013, we set up an artisan workshop that includes different disciplines such as furniture making, painting, enamel on metal and pottery. Our mission is to revalue Mexican crafts while preserving traditional techniques and processes to create handicrafts with a contemporary design. Each of our pieces has the style of an individual artisan. Amonite Kutsari has improved the lives of everyone with whom we've collaborated since it allows us access to marketplaces. We've gotten close like a family and our individual traits have fortified the workshop's spirit and the crafts we create. Our designs have a traditional style that complements contemporary décor, which makes them unique. Each member has unique skills that make it easy to create our designs and maintain our workshop.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDbRlJjtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B06XPZ5Q6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XPZ5Q6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XPZ5Q6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
