window.products.push({"id":195118,"name":"Smart Warm and Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, Syvio 6L Top Fill Air Humidifiers for Baby, Plants, Pets, Whole House Quickly Humidify up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619FnsTRiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝Warm & Cool Mist: Syvio Humidifiers for Bedroom is a perfect partner for air conditioners and heaters, stay healthy and comfortable all year round. The warm mist helps absorb the thermal radiation of the heater, eliminate harmful substances in water, beat congestion, creating soothe sore throats in the Autumn & Winter, and the cool mist helps keep cool and moisturized in the Summer & Spring. Ideal gift to your babies, parents, lovers, pets, and plants. 🌟Rapid Warm Humidification Mode: 4X faster than other humidifiers, Syvio warm and cool mist humidifiers comes with a faster warm mist mode to achieve quick access to a warm and moisturizing environment without any waiting, quick relief discomfort for you or your family in a pinch, this is essential in the cold winter season. BPA-free to ensure your family, pets, and plants are in good health. 💙Smart Auto Constant Humidity Design - No longer worry about over-humidification! With the built-in smart humidity sensor Tech, Syvio air humidifiers can be auto on and off to achieve fully automatic operation. It will automatically turn off at your target humidity, and it will turn back on automatically when the surrounding humidity is below your target humidity. 50%-60%RH is advised for home and office, 60%-70%RH for plants, and 40%-50%RH for pets. 🌟60Hrs Long Run Times & 𝟯 Levels 𝗠𝗶𝘀𝘁 𝗢𝘂𝘁𝗽𝘂𝘁 - With large 6 L tank, cover up to 70m²/755 sq.ft, run for up to 60 hours with a low mist output one fill, needn't constant refills. Syvio humidifiers for bedroom come with 3 Optional Mist Level(L(160ml/h)/M(330ml/h)/H(500ml/h))for a precise humidity output. 𝗨𝗹𝘁𝗿𝗮𝘀𝗼𝗻𝗶𝗰 𝗧𝗲𝗰𝗵, below 26dB, keep quiet, ideal for your bedroom, office, baby room, plants nursery, pets room, etc. 💝Multifunction in One, A Great Gift - With a built-in aroma oil area in the sink to retain the strong aroma, please do not pour it directly into the water tank; With Timer Setting(1~12 Hours), Sleep Mode and Optional Night Light, below 26 dB, never worry about your baby waking up at the mid-night with congestion! It is filterless, 2 cute fish filters can absorb the harmful substances that can't be filtered in the water, and increase the fun. We provide 100% Customer Satisfaction Service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619FnsTRiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"syvio","source_asin":"B0B8S9LMY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8S9LMY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8S9LMY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195119,"name":"OXO Obsidian Pre-Seasoned Carbon Steel, 10\" Frying Pan Skillet with Removable Silicone Handle Holder, Induction, Oven Safe, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cOPpPXENL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lighter, easier and stronger—there’s a reason carbon steel is the choice of professional kitchens. Pre-seasoned to get you started, this OXO Obsidian Carbon Steel 10-In Frypan develops a naturally non-stick layer with use that’s ideal for frying delicate fish, crafting an omelet, or getting a perfect sear on pork chops. The more you use the pan, the better the non-stick patina layer will be. Precision engineered for powerful performance anywhere you need it, this pan travels effortlessly from stovetop to grill. This pan also comes with a removable silicone sleeve to keep cooking comfortable. Oven safe up to 600˚F/315˚C. Hand wash only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cOPpPXENL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B09LX61D3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LX61D3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LX61D3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
