window.products.push({"id":195159,"name":"Zojirushi NS-ZCC18 Neuro Fuzzy 10-Cup Rice Cooker and Warmer (Premium White) with Recipe Book, Bamboo Spoon, and Measuring Spoon Set Bundle (4 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pC9CXVICL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Compact and convenient, the Zojirushi Neuro Fuzzy Rice Cooker and Warmer is a reliably versatile kitchen appliance for making all the rice recipes. Whether you like white or brown, or prefer the rinse-free variety of rice, this is the machine for you. With its 2 delay start options and automatic, as well as extended Keep Warm settings, Neuro Fuzzy will accommodate any situation. What's more, the advanced Neuro Fuzzy technology ensures the rice is fluffy and delicious with automatically customized cooking temperature and heating time adjustments. Practical Design With the full range of rice cooking options, including porridge, sweet, semi-brown, brown, rinse-free and sushi rice you'll be able to make a wide variety of delicious rice based dishes. Cook for yourself, your family or throw a party - this compact machine may take up less than a foot of your countertop space, yet it fits up to 10 cups of cooked rice inside. Its spherical inner pan sports stay cool side handles for safe retrieval and handling, while its convenient inner lid detaches for washing. Additionally, the rice cooker is equipped with fold-down handle and retractable power cord for convenient storage. Bundle Includes: Zojirushi Neuro Fuzzy 10-Cup Rice Cooker and Warmer Zojirushi Neuro Fuzzy 10-Cup Rice Cooker and Warmer Ultimate Rice Cooker Recipe Book: 250 No-Fail Recipes Ultimate Rice Cooker Recipe Book: 250 No-Fail Recipes Harold Import Co. Helen's Asian Kitchen Bamboo Spoon (15-Inch) Harold Import Co. Helen's Asian Kitchen Bamboo Spoon (15-Inch) Update International MEA-SPDX Heavy Gauge Stainless Steel Measuring Spoon Set Update International MEA-SPDX Heavy Gauge Stainless Steel Measuring Spoon Set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pC9CXVICL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zojirushi","source_asin":"B08QSB3T98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QSB3T98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QSB3T98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
