window.products.push({"id":195162,"name":"Kotton Culture Blood Red Custom Size Duvet Cover 100% Egyptian Cotton 3 Piece with Hidden Zipper & Corner Ties 600 Thread Count Duvet Protector Soft S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bswk2Ge+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEED CUSTOM DIMENSIONS: We provide duvet sets that are made to order to fit the dimension of your bed. To benefit from our customization service, simply choose a color, select the ORDER CUSTOM SIZE option, click the yellow “CUSTOMIZE NOW” button, enter the desired dimensions for your duvet cover and pillow shams, and place your order. It’s that simple! 600 THREAD COUNT: Sleep better knowing that you’re wrapped up in the warmth of Kotton Culture’s duvet covers. Climbing into bed after a long day is one of the most relaxing feelings in the world. Enrich this experience with our quilt cover sets that feel silk-like and soft against your skin! Our cotton collection is so snug, it’s the perfect excuse to stay in bed. Each fluffy duvet cover is densely woven with a sateen weave to be breathable and long-lasting. COLORFUL CHOICES: Our designs are a visual treat that bring beauty and comfort to your home and you. Add character and depth to your room while getting it ready for snuggles and restful sleep. From blush pink and royal burgundy to warmer alternatives such as ivory, beige and charcoal gray – we’ve got something for every taste. DESIGN YOUR DREAM BEDROOM: Do you have an inflatable bed for when the guests visit, or a split mattress in your master bedroom? Wondering how to style a loft bed in your apartment? Our size customization gives you complete freedom to create a haven to fit your style and size. Whether your bedroom is big or small, in line with coquette room décor or indie room décor or anything in between, we will help you make the most of relaxing at home. MACHINE WASHABLE: Our linens get softer with every wash and are easy on your conscience as the cotton used to weave them is sustainably sourced. To keep it clean, wash in cold water, tumble dry low, and iron on low to keep wrinkles at bay. To keep your cotton sheet sets and coverlets looking crisp for longer, avoid using a fabric softener, use a short dry cycle and pull out your twin bed comforter cover promptly from the dryer. ONE-STOP SHOP FOR BEDDING: The right choice of bedding can make even the most oddly sized mattresses look stylish. A soft pillow to rest your head or a warm comforter to cuddle under: our range has got everything you need to make your slumber cozier. Want to make your space feel homely? We’ve also got waffle knit throws, velvet shams, and bed skirts. So dress up your bed in our finest bed spreads and customize it with your favorite quilts, blankets, and home textiles in rich colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bswk2Ge+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotton Culture","source_asin":"B0BXXDKXLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXXDKXLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXXDKXLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
