window.products.push({"id":195181,"name":"Warm Home Designs 1 Panel of Black Blackout Curtains with Grommets. Insulated Thermal Window Panel is 54\" X 84\" in Size and Includes Matching Tie-Back","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617fCOedIwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅ BUY BLACKOUT WINDOW CURTAINS AT HALF THE COST OF DEPARTMENT STORE PRICES - Because stores act as a middleman and take a large portion of the profit, similar quality curtains in the big department store could cost twice as much. Patio Door and Wall-to-Wall panels can cost up to 3 times our prices. Warm Home Designs Blackout Curtains are not sold in stores but directly to consumers so they are priced at a level anyone can afford. ✅ GET BETTER SLEEP, REDUCE OUTSIDE NOISE & SAVE ON UTILITIES - Our high-quality standard length 54\" x 84\" single Black color room darkening blackout panels are tested to block at least 97% of sun's light for better, more relaxing sleep. Insulated material reduces outside noise and provides privacy everyone needs, while thermal curtains lining saves you money by keeping your home cooler during the summer and warmer during the winter. ✅ ALMOST 100 DIFFERENT COLOR/SIZE COMBINATIONS - A typical shop will have 3 colors and 2 most common sizes. We offer 7 colors and 16 sizes that will fit YOUR UNIQUE windows and home interiors. We sell 54\" curtain panels in 84, 96, inch lengths; pairs of 2 38\" panels in 84, 96 and 108 length and 54 x 18 valance and scalloped valances and 30 x 36 cafe tiers. We also offer 102 Inch Patio Door Curtains in 2 sizes & rare Wall to Wall drapes in 4 lengths and total width of 216 inches (18 Feet). ✅ GET A FREE CURTAIN TIE-BACK WITH EACH PANEL PURCHASED - Our customers asked for it for years and now we finally have them. Both 54 inch single panels, 38 inch pairs and wall to wall room dividers come with free matching curtain holdbacks for a luxurious look that others do not have. Tie-back are not available for patio door curtains and valance scarves only. ✅ BUY WITH 100% CONFIDENCE - unlike most of our vompetitors, we don't give away free products to get 5-star reviews. All of our reviews come from real, verified Amazon customers just like you, so you can buy our room darkening drapes with confidence. If you not satisfied with our products for any reason just contact Amazon customer support and they will replace or refund your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617fCOedIwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warm Home Designs","source_asin":"B09Q4QCJ92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q4QCJ92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q4QCJ92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
