window.products.push({"id":195217,"name":"ZINUS 2 Inch Copper Pressure Relief TorsoTec Memory Foam Mattress Topper / Cooling Copper and Gel Formula, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d--5ckUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The intelligently designed Copper TorsoTec Memory Foam Topper combines proprietary zoned technology with the natural thermoregulating power of copper. Crafted specifically to provide extra comfort and support in high pressure areas, such as shoulders and hips, this topper contours to your curves to relieve aches and pains. Its innovative copper infusion helps to maintain freshness naturally, meaning that you get to doze off on a cleaner, like-new mattress night after night. Plus, the copper works with our unique gel foam to draw heat away from the body as you slumber for a more optimal sleep temperature. And we’ve wrapped it all up in one compact box and added a 5-year warranty just so you have some extra peace of mind. The perfect solution to add pressure-relieving support and clean comfort to your existing bed without the new mattress price tag!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d--5ckUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B082KTBKFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082KTBKFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082KTBKFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195218,"name":"King Size Weighted Blanket(15lbs, 88\"x104\"), Queen or King Size Bed Adult Heavy Blanket with 100% Soft Cotton and Glass Beads Dark Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ghBnPxwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton ✅TRUE KING SIZE WEIGHTED BLANKET--Our blanket is 88\" x 104\". Some of the so-called \"king size\" blankets are actually much smaller. It wasn't big enough to hang off the edges of the queen or full bed like a bedspread--ours does!GOHOME weighted king size blanket also can be shared with two people, Real Couple Weighted Blanket! (CARE INSTRUCTION: Machine wash separately in warm or cold water. Dry cleaning blanket if necessary. A removable duvet cover is recommended for easy cleaning) ✅TRUE 7-LAYERS DESIGN & SMALLER INNER POCKET&SUPERB WORKMANSHIP STANDARD--100% cotton outer fabric and inner batting, chosen for its softness, breathability, and durability. Cool enough for all climates. Double stitching sewed with an elegant quilting pattern, which made the square pocket much smaller (4\"x4\") for more evenly distribute the weight and most adaption to your body shape. The innovative design also avoid glass beads leakage and secures the durability of the blanket for decades ✅VARIOUS WEIGHTS OPTIONS: GOHOME weighted blankets come in four sizes, with weights ranging from 15 to 40 pounds. Pls refer to the product image \"weighted and size \" chart. Choose the weight of a blanket you want to experience. For blankets of the same weight, the larger the size of the blanket, the smaller the pressure the human body feels ✅A PERFECT GIFT CHOICE--Sewed with reinforced stitching and 8 loops (keep it in place inside the cover). With classic and elegant design at the edge of the blanket, our cotton weighted blanket also forms part of your home decor! Not only on the bed but on the couch, on the chair, wherever you want. Can be given as a gift to a friend, relative or yourself！ ✅RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Complete customer satisfaction is our top priority! The five-star rating of GOHOME store is your confidence guarantee for worry-free purchase, and it is also the driving force of our continuous improvement. If you have any questions about our products, please do not hesitate to contact us,we will spare no effort to assist you to solve any problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714ghBnPxwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOHOME","source_asin":"B09FSRL5ZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FSRL5ZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FSRL5ZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
