window.products.push({"id":195260,"name":"Leather Placemats for Dining Table Set of 2, Heat Resistant Easy to Clean Wipeable Waterproof Washable Modern Placemats for Kitchen Diner Table, Non S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWFDJRFzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝【High Quality Synthetic Leather】Our leather table mats are made of durable, stain & spill resistant, anti-skid environmental 100% faux leather polyester. The table placemats has stronger flexibility, fold to tear pull not easy be out of shape, fine workmanship and they are heavy duty enough to last for long time use. 💝【Good Insulation】Heat-resistant and anti-skid to a certain degree, beautiful kitchen table mats are double thickened and both sides can be used, enhancing the insulation. it is not only effectively protect your dinner table from scratches but also extend the life of your table. 💝【Elegant irregular shape】Graceful placemats with exquisite design and classic color can perfect decorate your dinner table and add more fun to your kitchen table. Leather placemats set of 2 (2*placemats + 2*coasters), two large placemats (16.14*13inch) & two small coasters (5.1*4.3inch). 💝【Easy to Clean and Care】Washable and easy to clean up, clean the table mat in time after dirty, wipe with a wet cloth or rinse with running water, wipe or air dry. No machine wash. Non-fading, it can roll up to store away, leather placemat can be flattened when put out to use. 💝【Multiple Uses】The leather placemats what match all kinds of tables are perfect size for daily use. Perfect for family kitchen, dining tables, coffee tables, restaurants, hotel or business office, or good match with dark wood table, glass table, white dining table, wooden farmhouse table. Great for BBQ, party, holiday. 💝 Warm Notes: The colors may exist slight differences due to different screens. If you have any problem please contact us whenever you need. We will help to solve to your 100% satisfaction. Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YWFDJRFzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QPIX DIGITAL","source_asin":"B0B8219698","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8219698","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8219698","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
