window.products.push({"id":195269,"name":"Gift Set of 8 Whiskey Chilling Stones [Chill Rocks] - in Premium Wooden Gift Box with Stainless Steel Tongs and Velvet Carrying Pouch - Made of Pure S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716SG8-kFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chill Rocks is the aficionado's choice for “on the rocks”. It eliminates a common problem for all connoisseurs of fine distilled spirits. It will add the perfect chill without diluting it down. Now all your favorite drinks are able to be served the way they were intended to be, pure and properly chilled. Chill Rocks are non-porous, meaning, there is no odor or taste to tarnish your drink. Unlike ice, Chill Rocks provides a smooth chill that does not overwhelm the character of your beverage. Each set of Chill Rocks comes with eight finely crafted cubes made from pure soapstone. Chill Rocks is a great gift for anyone who loves the perfectly chilled beverage. You can even use it as a conversation starter at your next party. Simply keep the Chill Rocks in your freezer until you are ready to chill your favorite drink or beverage.. Use: Rinse before first usage then place in your freezer until the stones reach desired coldness. When ready, add two or three stones to your glass. Fill the glass with enough liquid to cover the stones. Let the drink sit for a few minutes, allowing the stones to properly chill your drink. After use, simply rinse and allow the stones to dry before placing them back in the freezer. Never chew or attempt to eat. About Soapstone: Known for its ability to maintain a temperature for long periods of time. Soapstone is made up of talc which will not react to water, alcohol and or other drinks. If used with care, soapstone will not scratch your glasses. Proper Usage: Chill Rocks are not meant to cool as a drink as quickly or as much as ice. They are intended to provide a slight chill-between 8 and 15 degrees-that will protect the taste without drowning the quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716SG8-kFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quiseen","source_asin":"B07KFQHV1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KFQHV1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KFQHV1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
