window.products.push({"id":195284,"name":"AIDLNS Couple Figurie Music Box Gift, Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure Musical Box, Anniversary Figurines Valentine's Day Gift for Wife Husband Boyfriend ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615bkruHUhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DESIGN INSPIRATION: This breathtaking sculpture tells the story of a couple standing at the bow of a ship, gazing out at the endless horizon. The man stands behind the woman, holding her waist as she spreads her arms in a flying position, as if ready to take on the world. The sculpture exudes passion and longing, with the figures' bodies seemingly prepared to take flight at any moment. The woman's outstretched arms seem to tell us that with love, anything is possible. MUSICAL FIGURINES AND STATUES: This sculpture is more than just a beautiful work of art. It also doubles as a music box, with a unique mechanism that plays the catchy tune of \"My Heart Will Go On.\" The song's gentle and poignant melody speaks to the enduring power of love, making this sculpture a perfect symbol of romance. GIFT FOR LOVER: A precious memory gift for a lover. It is a luxury gift for a wife, girlfriend, sweetheart, husband, or boyfriend as a birthdays gifts, anniversary gift, Christmas gift, mother's day gift, father's day gift, wedding gift, etc. The hand-painted couple gift for husband and wife figure comes with a fitted box ready for gift-giving. MATERIAL & SIZE: it is made of high-quality natural resin, Hand-polished by our professional designers, and uses colorless and odorless environmental protection water paint to color by hand. Extremely durable and long-lasting. The size is about 7*3.5*3inch. This music box is safe and securely packaged in protective gift kraft box packaging. It’s a gift full of love that will arrive in perfect condition. EASY TO USE: Our beautiful item plays clear music without batteries. It is easy to use. Wind up by turning the bottom spring 3-4 times, release, and the figure will play excellent music. COLLECTION STATUE: An expression of love, This hand-painted love figure, through its unique appearance, represents an emotion or marks a memory, closeness, healing, courage, hope, expresses love, all the feelings of a life well lived. This sculpted hand-painted love statue is a perfect ornament ready to display on a shelf, table, or mental. HOME Décor Accents: This sculpture isn't just for gift-giving – it's also a beautiful addition to your home decor. Imagine displaying it in your living room or bedroom, where it can bring a touch of romance and whimsy to your space. Whether you choose to use it as a music box or enjoy it as a work of art, this sculpture is sure to be a conversation piece and a source of joy for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615bkruHUhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDLNS","source_asin":"B0BRHGPLDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRHGPLDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRHGPLDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
