window.products.push({"id":195414,"name":"White Buffet Cabinet with Storage, 55” Mid-Century Coffee Bar Cabinet with 2 Drawers & 4 Doors for Dining Room, Cupboard Credenza Buffet Storage Sideb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qPM6jhpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Your Room More Tidy ------- Dimensions of buffet cabinet with storage are 55\"L x 15.7\" W x 30\" H. Entire sideboard cabinet consists of 2 drawers and 4 doors. Large storage space provides a place for your cutlery, pots and pans, wine bottles and more. Organizing has become an easy task, and your room has become more tidy. Mid Century Retro Design ------- Combination of white sideboard cabinet and wooden tabletop is a versatile style. The handle has been replaced with a vintage black metal handle with a pull tab, creates a mid-century style with the white sideboard. The most commendable is the 6 retro feet at the bottom, which make the retro style of the whole cabinet more intense, and pull you into a medieval palace at once. Sturdy for Long Time Used ---- Kitchen buffet sideboard storage cabinet is made of high quality P2 particle board which can extend the lifespan well. 6 solid wood feet at the bottom for good stability. White sideboard cabinet is a sturdy guardian of the kitchen and dining room. Multifunctional Storage Cabinet ------- Due to its elegant design, buffet cabinet will be a bright furniture decoration wherever it is placed. White sideboard cabinet can not only be placed in the kitchen as a buffet sideboard, or a coffee bar cabinet in the dining room but also at the end of the corridor is a very good entryway cabinet, and its excellent storage function can also become a chest of drawers in your bedroom, and a modern TV stand in the living room. Thoughtful Customer-Service Without Worries ------- Assembling a white buffet cabinet with your partner is a simple task. Clear instructions and complete accessories make your assembly work easier. Hurry up and bring it into your kitchen to make your work easy and enjoyable. Effective customer service communication to solve after-sales problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qPM6jhpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4 EVER WINNER","source_asin":"B0B6PQ5829","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6PQ5829","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6PQ5829","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
