window.products.push({"id":195508,"name":"TETOTE 24 Inch Round Bathroom LED Vanity Mirror, Anti-Fog Dimmable Lights IP54 Waterproof Circle Makeup Wall Mounted Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0TrUB1QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【Dimmable Led Lights Mirror With Smart Memory】 10%-100% stepless brightness can be adjusted from daylight to super bright (but not recommended as the main lighting in the bathroom). Press the touch switch to turn on LED lights and adjust the brightness. Cri 90+ renders light perfectly for makeup or selfie. The smart memory always keeps the brightness before you turn off last time. Thoughtful design to save your time. ✨【Specific Anti-Fog Function For Bathroom】Modern touch switch on the mirror can separately control the anti-fog function. It needs few minutes to clean the fog on the LED bathroom mirror completely. Please turn on the anti-fog switch in advance before you use it. ✨【High Quality Materials & Safety】 Conforming to U.S. Producing standard, this bathroom LED vanity round mirror adopts environmental friendly, copper free HQ silver coating glass, and IP54 waterproof LED lights to ensure 100% safety in wet bathroom. ✨【Reliable Packing & Easy Installation】The mirror size is 24 inch. The package size is 27.6*27.6*3.7 inch. TETOTE circle LED lighted vanity mirror is secured by buffer foam box with extra protection. Plug and screws are included the package. Fix the screws on the wall to hold this round LED bathroom mirror. Use plug to plugin power outlet or directly connect switch by hard wire. Recommend the mirror is installed by a professional electrician. ✨【100% Customer Satisfaction】We value our customer and commit customer service will be respond within 24 hours. 100% broken/chipped mirror on arrival replacement or refund guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0TrUB1QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tetote","source_asin":"B09NGKGGH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NGKGGH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NGKGGH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195509,"name":"SEEDEEM Toaster 2 Slice, Stainless Steel Bread Toaster with Colorful LCD Display, 7 Bread Shade Settings, 1.4'' Wide Slots Toaster with Bagel/Defrost/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KXNh3q-3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Control: The 900W toaster has a colorful LCD timer display, so you can clearly see shade setting and the countdown. You know when the bread will pop-up, so you can arrange time properly. 4-in-1 Functions: ① Cancel--Stop the toaster at any time. ② Bagel--Special mode for baking bagels on one side only. ③ Defrost--Soften your frozen hard bread. ④ Reheat--Heat bread for 40s again. Multiple Flavor: SEEDEEM toaster provides 7 shade setting from light yellow to deep dark. The special 4 gear can bake delicious bread that is not too dry but full of burnt flavor. 2 pieces of bread baked at the same time will be more uniform. Extra Wide Slots: 1.4''×5.1'' wide slots can accommodate different types and thicknesses of bread, including white bread, bagels, English muffins, etc. The elastic heating net keeps your bread in the center of baking. Easy Operation & Cleaning: The precise knob will take you to the correct settings. Flexible lift lever for smooth dropping and auto ejecting of bread. Removable crumb tray helps you collect and dump falling crumbs to avoid staining your desktop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KXNh3q-3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEEDEEM","source_asin":"B09HMN86BF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HMN86BF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HMN86BF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
