window.products.push({"id":195511,"name":"Bedsure Down Alternative Comforter Set Twin (68 x 88 inches) - 300GSM Reversible Bed Comforter with Box-Stitching Pattern - Soft Microfiber Duvet Inse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613rO4mxn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP: Featuring classic box-stitching crafts, Bedsure Quilted Comforters remain evenly distributed over you, providing a uniform cloudy surface for the most relaxing sleep - 300GSM quilted comforter puffs to loft more fully even in the corners - Whole piece down alternative comforter stays smooth and fluffy after long-term use. HIGH QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of finest brushed microfiber shell and 100% microfiber fill, our bed comforter provides a supremely soft feel and breathable warmth (without being too hot or heavy under it) - Down alternative comforters mimic the warmth of down which has the feathers/odors easier to cause skin sensitivities. EXCELLENT DESIGN & DECOR: Sewn corner tabs that fitted right on the cover ties to protect the duvet insert from slipping - Flip the comforter over with black/gray colors to change the look of your bedroom in an instant - Classic style of this bed comforter is suitable for all season use to suit your mood anytime or bring enhanced beauty to any room decor. OUTSTANDING FEATURES: Stitched through all layers, quilted comforters create walls between top and bottom layers to prevent fill from clumping or shifting - Bed comforter stands up to washing and the tight stitching WON’T come loose, ball up or split along the seam - We recommend that you wash the comforter before use (help fluff the comforter). Available in Bedsure Reversible Down Alternative Quilted Comforter - 300GSM Bed Comforter - Soft Microfiber Duvet Insert, Twin(68\"x88\"), Black/Grey .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613rO4mxn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B07RRNB1SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RRNB1SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RRNB1SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195512,"name":"Dalstrong Paring Knife - 4 inch - Omega Series - BD1N-V Hyper Steel Kitchen Knife - G10 Woven Fiberglass Handle - Razor Sharp Knife - Leather Sheath I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717a4EvfSqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Omega Series Knives are a precision made instrument. Ideal for briskets, roasts, ham, turkey, sides of salmon, and expertly suited for prepping large fruits and vegetables, slicing bread loaves and layer cakes, the screamingly sharp blade ensures ultra-thin, uniform slices in a single stroke. These Knives are a required addition for every pitmaster, chef, baker, home cook, & more. The “LiquidMetal” pattern on the blade reduces drag and increases efficiency, allowing you to glide through prep. Featuring ultra-premium American forged BD1N-VX hyper steel, the addition of Nitrogen increases hardness, flexibility, and toughness, while the blade's composition and added vacuum heat-treatment to 63HRC provide astonishing performance, with a screamingly sharp edge. Painstakingly finished to 8-12° per side by expert blade smiths using the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method. The G10 woven fibreglass handle is near impervious to heat, cold and moisture and is presented in a midnight black with subtle dark red colorings. Centered in the full-tang handle is an ornate and over-sized copper and brass mosaic, creating a distinct and striking appearance. The painstakingly detailed craftsmanship continues with the Dalstrong lionhead insignia carefully engraved on both the mirror-polished end-cap and blade itself. A black PU leather sheath with button clip and distinctive red-stitching is also included to ensure the blades stylish protection and your own safety. Featuring all the precision, premium materials and workmanship you would expect from Dalstrong, only dialled up. See why thousands of professional chefs and home cooks love and trust the DALSTRONG DIFFERENCE. 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk free, we know you'll love it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717a4EvfSqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B0C35D3C2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C35D3C2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C35D3C2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
