window.products.push({"id":195699,"name":"COTA Global Brown Sailboat Decor – Handmade Wooden Boat Decor, Cute Beach Style Model Sail Boat Decorations, Nautical Themed Table Top Decor Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LWoe+U-cL._AC_.jpg","description":"THE BROWN WOODEN BOAT MODEL COMES WITH A UNIQUE DESIGN YOU LOVE – Bring the experience of cruising the wide-open sea by the charming sailing boat. Displaying beach theme room decor such as the distressed wooden home decor boat to a mantle, shelves, bathroom, or bedroom bring on the feel of the deep blue ocean to your home. A bright beach themed home decor for a classic nautical-themed home or as charming lighthouse outdoor decor. THE BROWN BOAT DECORATION IS FOR THOSE WHO LOVE THE SEA – If you dream about sailing and love sail boats, display the Brown Sailboat decoration as one of your beach themed decor for home. Model boat complements the brown and white palette of your nautical-themed home. Brown Sailboat is a perfect gift for those who love ocean travel. A nautical boat perfect for replicating the charm of staying in a beach house or seaside. INCLUDED WITH THE WOOD NAUTICAL DECOR SAILBOAT ORNAMENT – Includes 1 Brown Sailing Model Boat with stand. The wooden sailing boat features the jib and mainsail as a canvas cloth tied to the brown and white hull. Sailing boat decoration fits any sea themed table top or desk. Model sailboat figure is beautifully designed and looks like a simple and unique sea decor. The Brown nautical decor boat measures 10Lx1.75Wx18H inches. HIGH QUALITY BROWN BOAT MODEL DECOR – Made of premium quality wood, the nautical boat ornament is both durable and lightweight. The sailboat statue is not a model kit and is already beautifully assembled. Painted by hand in brown and white, the wooden sailboat decoration would charm guests with its simple and unique details. Place as a charming bathroom boat decor, living room boat centerpiece, or fun beach party decorations. IDEAL USE FOR THE BROWN WOODEN BOAT DECORATION – The Brown Boat Display is the perfect present for nautical display lovers. CoTa Global’s sailboat gifts are designed and made by hand with charming nautical details, cool colors and when added to a room feel like a ship’s cabin. Sail boat decoration comes with a flat steady stand for display; to be placed on a shelf, office desk, or mantle along with nautical knick knacks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LWoe+U-cL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B00LV2O9I0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LV2O9I0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LV2O9I0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
