window.products.push({"id":195704,"name":"Hramk Office Chair Mid Back Swivel Desk Chair with Flip-up Arms, Breathable Mesh Computer Chair, Lumbar Support Task Chair with Wheels, Height Adjusta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HQoNnDcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design: The back rest is designed to conform to the shape of the human spine, and with built-in lumbar support, this office chair will give your shoulder and lower back well support. Breathable & Comfortable: The back of office chair features a breathable mesh design that avoids sweat and stickiness. High density new foam-filled seat cushion is soft and good resilient, relieves pressure on the hips. Armrests are also filled with soft padding. It's an ideal chair for your home, office, conference room and reception. Adjustable Office Chair: 15 degrees back rest rocking back and forth; Pneumatic seat height adjustment from 17.72'' to 21.65''; 360 degrees seat swivel; The flip-up arms can be rotated 90 degrees. Saving Your Space: This mesh computer chair comes with 90 degrees flip-up arms. Lift the armrest, it can be putted under the desk, and save your work space. Heavy-Duty Base: This task chair has a sturdy metal wheelbase that can support up to 250 pounds. Smooth-rolling wheels provide great stability and mobility. The cylinder is passed BIFMA certification. Easy to Assemble: You can easily assemble this office chair in 15 minutes with the help of instruction and video. No extra tools are needed. Weights & Dimensions: Overall: 23.22''(D) x 24.02''(W) x 42.13''(H); Seat: 18.9''(W) x 19.30''(D); Seat Height: 17.72'' - 21.65''; Back Rest: 18.5''(W) x 20.9''(H); Overall Product Weight: 23.2 lb. Customer Service: Desk chair enjoy 1 year warranty. Amazon free return service. If you have any further questions about this chair, please contact us via Amazon messages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HQoNnDcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hramk","source_asin":"B0BGT1TN69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGT1TN69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGT1TN69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195705,"name":"BUILT Gourmet Getaway Soft Neoprene Lunch Tote Bag-Lightweight, Insulated and Reusable, Micro Dot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qRiexGesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Gourmet Getaway Lunch Tote from BUILT makes it easy to go gourmet at school, work, or any time on-the-go. Made for environmentally conscious people who want to reduce waste and considered the gold standard among reusable insulated lunch totes. This mid-sized, stretchy neoprene lunch tote is made from durable, machine washable neoprene. No need to worry about accidents and spills inside or outside because you can easily machine wash it on cold and let it air dry. Also, it’s BPA-free, vinyl-free, PVC-free and tested for lead safety - tested for your safety in mind. The neoprene construction helps keeps food cold (or warm) for up to 4 hours, depending on the content and outside temperature; the cooler the contents the longer they will stay cold. Also, the neoprene material allows the lunch tote to expand to fit a variety of food and drink containers with a flat bottom to sit upright. This tote packs more than you would think but is still able to fold flat to take up less space and store easily. This lunch tote has a smooth secure zipper closure to keep your lunch inside when you are on the go. The soft grip neoprene handles make it easy to carry and the neoprene stretches for maximum comfort on your fingers. Available in a variety of fun colors and patterns. From the Manufacturer Great for road trips, plane rides, or any time you're on the run and need provisions to keep you going. And unlike those brown bags, you'll want to reuse one of these insulated lunch bags over and over again. If you're a foodie who spends time in the culinary fast lane, then the Gourmet Getaway is for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qRiexGesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUILT","source_asin":"B0BHXNSG7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHXNSG7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHXNSG7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
