window.products.push({"id":195768,"name":"JULGIRL Oversized Wearable Blanket for Women and Men Sherpa Fleece Thick Warm Hoodie with Giant Pocket Super Cozy Giant Blanket Hoodie for Teenagers G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711nMyhVI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Imported ✿ Warm Hoodie Blanket: This oversized wearable sweatshirt is made from soft premium polyester fleece and fluffy polyester lamb fleece for a soft touch that will keep you warm from head to toe. The large plush hat keeps your head warm and is long enough to wrap your legs warm and comfortable, moving freely without curling. ✿ Unique Design: This hooded sweatshirt has large front pockets to store your phone, keys, snacks, and you can reach inside for extra warmth, keeping you warm wherever you go. Our blanket hoodies are up to 40% long; also up to 80%; they cover most of your body so you can choose the length that suits your needs. This hoodie is oversized so you can easily tuck your entire body into the plush, fluffy Sherpa hoodie to keep your entire figure as warm and comfortable as lying in a quilt. ✿ Occasion: This hoodie will not only keep you warm and comfortable when lounging around the house, reading, playing, using the computer, taking a nap, enjoying sporting events; it's also your morning walk in the park, dog walking, fall and winter campfires and camping The temperature of the whole body is still maintained. In short, you can wear a blanket anywhere in the cold winter! ✿ Size: There are two sizes of the same lazy sweater, but the length of the sweater is different. The shorter one is more convenient for doing housework at home; the ankle-length sweater is warmer and more suitable for watching TV and eating snacks on the sofa at home. Size S----length is 90 cm; size M----length is 140. According to your own needs, choose a sweater that is more suitable for you. ✿ Gift and Wash: This blanket hoodie is the perfect gift for kids, moms, dads, wives, husbands, siblings, friends during the winter holidays. It is also a great gift for friends who live in cold areas and are prone to colds! This sweatshirt is an easy care, durable blanket that can be machine washed in cold water, tumble dry low, no ironing or expensive cleaning!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711nMyhVI1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JULGIRL","source_asin":"B0B41JKV2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41JKV2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41JKV2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":195769,"name":"CYMULA Weighted Blanket for Adults 15lbs 60\"x 80\" Queen Size Light Grey Weighted Blankets for 140-180 lb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FScMU8FAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ACCOMPANY YOU ALL YEAR ROUND】The surface of the weighted blanket is made of 100% polyester fabric, the inside of the weighted blanket includes 5 layers of super soft cotton compartments, not only is not easy to wrinkle, but also feels very comfortable. Thanks to the soft touch and glass beads with specific functions, it will keep you quilt and provide you with comfort all night long. 【IMPROVE YOUR QUALITY SLEEP】 Density comfort weighted blanket, the filling is double-layer cotton with good fluff. It is a weighted blanket that can drive away the uncomfortable of your day. If you are tired during the working day, a heavy blanket for health is perfect. It makes you feel warm and relaxed, and gives you a peaceful dream. 【INTIMATE INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE】If your weight is between 110-140 lbs, we suggest you buy a 12 lb adult weighted blanket; if your weight is between 140-180 lbs, we suggest you buy a 15 lb weighted blanket ; if your weight is between 180-220 lbs, we suggest you buy a 20 lb weighted blanket. If your bed size is 60\"x 80\", we recommend you to buy the product marked \"60\"x 80\" Queen size\" (of course you can choose according to your preference). 【SUITABLE FOR ANY OCCASION】 It can be used not only in sleep but also when you are having a nap, reading or watching television. Can also be as a gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's, Mother's, Father's Day and Christmas Day. Since this is a heavy blanket, we hope you can give yourself 7-15 days to get used to it, then enjoy all quality premium weighted blanket's benefits. We believe your friends or lover will love it. 【EASY CARE AND CLEANING】Blankets are more suitable for hand washing or simply wiping. Although our weighted blankets feature new sewing techniques to ensure the blankets won't thread, the fabric's dense stitching and durable threads prevent glass beads from leaking, we still don't recommend machine washing. In addition, we recommend that you can buy a duvet cover, then you can easily machine wash the duvet cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FScMU8FAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYMULA","source_asin":"B0B3GR64SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3GR64SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3GR64SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
