window.products.push({"id":195944,"name":"Large 11PC Japanese Tea Set \"Blue and Gold\" Cast Iron Tea Pot 26Oz with 4 Tea Cups (2Oz each), 4 Saucers, Leaf Tea Infuser and Trivet. Ceremonial Matc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FEswB+V3S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WHY TIMELESS? This tetsubin is probably the “Japanese greatest tea set” because it has been used for centuries and the love for its shape and colors never faded in the heart of people looking at it. That makes them the preferred Japanese tea pots for things like Corporate, Anniversaries, Weddings, or Engagement Gifts. THE LUXURIOUS COLOR - Observe the beautiful black mixed with the gorgeous gold. The association is amazing, isn’t it? Actually, both are symbols of Luxury and the special design of this teapot allow us to combine both of them, for an astonishing visual impact. WHAT'S IN THE SET? Contains one solid cast iron teapot weighing 3.2lbs and holds 25.36oz of your best quality Japanese Green Tea or brew of choice. 4 teacups with a classical round design and matching trivet, round shaped saucers and stainless steel tea infuser. Rust-Proof enamel inside, with a hand painted and glazed exterior, which makes this “tetsubin”, a tetsu kyusu! Made for brewing tea but not for boiling. A COMPLETE TEA SET? With 4 small 2oz cups and 4 matching saucers, this tea set is complete and you won’t need more. Also of note, Kiyoshi Luxury comes with follow up service to solve any shipping problems. Plus, a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee for risk free ordering. FOR SPECIAL TEA - You may know that Iron is the traditional element for 6th Anniversary Gifts for Men or Women, and special tea sets are adored by those who respect the stillness of ceremony. So if you’re looking for an exclusive and complete tea set, check out The Kiyoshi Color Timeless Collection and choose now the right color for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FEswB+V3S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIYOSHI Luxury","source_asin":"B08DCY4PG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-195944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DCY4PG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DCY4PG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
